hive switch rollback evidence\\n439ffeefa feat(store): add selectable java fallback rollback\\n9c515ec32 docs(rust-rewrite): record production ci gates\\n6e8369eaa ci(store): wire production rust gates\\n\\n---EVIDENCE FILES---\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/agent-coordination.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/api-gremlin-001-diagnosis-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/api-gremlin-001-independent-oracle-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/api-rest-001-independent-oracle-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/ci-gates-audit-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-1\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-10\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-11\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-12\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-13\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-14\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-15\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-16\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-2\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-3\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-4\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-5\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-6\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-7\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-8\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-9\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/continuation-gate-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/e2e-contract-matrix-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/e2e-snapshot-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/final-audit-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/final-audit-rerun-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/production-integration-audit-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/progress.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/raft-001-independent-oracle-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/schema-001-independent-oracle-20260913.md\\ndocs/evidence/rust-rewrite/snap-001-ind